# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — 裸 Makefile 库静态归档无 lib 前缀 → CMakeDeps "Library not found in package" ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-29
# Software: offbrand-lib 1.0.0 (theck01/offbrand_lib)
# Gate: conan-verify G2 (test_package find_package / CMakeDeps)
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     DRAFT-offbrand-lib-1.0.0-raw-makefile-nolib-prefix-cmakedeps
trigger_tool:           conan|conan create|conan-verify|cmake|CMakeDeps|test_package
phase:                  package|testing|verification
error_signature:        Library '[^']+' not found in package|conan_package_library_targets|cmakedeps_macros\.cmake.*message

severity:               2
category:               conan, packaging, recipe, makefile, cmake
match_keywords:         conanfile, package(), ARFLAGS, ar rvs, raw-makefile, no lib prefix,
                         offbrand.a, lib<name>.a, Library not found in package, CMakeDeps,
                         cmakedeps_macros, cpp_info.libs, rename, keep_path, package_folder, lib

title:                  裸 Makefile 库 ARFLAGS=rvs 产出无 lib 前缀静态归档（offbrand.a），
                        配方需在 package() 重命名为 lib<name>.a，否则 CMakeDeps 报
                        "Library 'xxx' not found in package"

root_cause: >
  上游纯 Makefile 库（无 configure、无 install 目标）用 ARFLAGS = rvs 直接生成归档
  bin/offbrand.a（无 lib 前缀）。Conan 2 的 CMakeDeps 按 lib<name>.a 约定在包内
  lib/ 目录查找静态库，找不到 liboffbrand.a 时 conan_package_library_targets 报
  "Library 'xxx' not found in package"，test_package 的 CMake configure 阶段失败
  （G2 FAIL）。即使 package() 已用 keep_path=False 正确落盘，只要归档文件名缺 lib
  前缀，CMakeDeps 仍无法解析消费者 target。

affected_scope:          任何 ARFLAGS/构建规则产出无 lib 前缀 .a 的裸 Makefile C 库
                         （raw-Makefile、无 install 目标）的 Conan 2 配方；对全部
                         CMakeDeps 消费者通用

verification_cmd: |
  conan create <recipe> -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
  # 失败特征: cmakedeps_macros.cmake:81 Library 'offbrand' not found in package
  # 修复前:  find package_folder -name '*.a'  -> package/lib/offbrand.a  (缺 lib 前缀)
  # 修复后:  find package_folder -name '*.a'  -> package/lib/liboffbrand.a

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           rename-nolib-prefix-archive-lib-prefix
rec_description: >
  package() 用 keep_path=False 把归档落盘到 package/lib 后，若文件名无 lib 前缀
  （如 offbrand.a、list.a），须重命名为 lib<name>.a，与 CMakeDeps 的 lib<name>.a
  查找约定对齐；name 即 conanfile 的 name（此处 offbrand-lib → liboffbrand.a），
  与 cpp_info.libs 列表中的库名一致。
rec_command: >
  import os
  copy(self, "offbrand.a", os.path.join(self.source_folder, "bin"),
       os.path.join(self.package_folder, "lib"), keep_path=False)
  os.rename(os.path.join(self.package_folder, "lib", "offbrand.a"),
            os.path.join(self.package_folder, "lib", "liboffbrand.a"))
  # cpp_info.libs = ["offbrand"]

forbid_1_pattern:        copy(self, "bin/offbrand.a", self.source_folder, package/lib)
forbid_1_reason:         pattern 保留 bin/ 尾部目录层 → lib/bin/offbrand.a（E097/DRAFT-list 已覆盖）；
                          且即使落盘正确，缺 lib 前缀仍触发 Library not found
forbid_2_pattern:        cpp_info.libs 改名绕过文件改名
forbid_2_reason:         CMakeDeps 以文件名查找，改 cpp_info.libs 名称不改变磁盘文件名，仍失败

applies_to:              无 configure/无 install 目标、构建产物为无 lib 前缀 .a 的裸 Makefile 库
counter_example:         上游产出 lib<name>.a 或 CMake target PREFIX "" 场景分别见
                         E221/DRAFT-libsnd（CMake 目标命名）与既有 lib 前缀库（无需改名）
limitations:             只解决 CMakeDeps 查找面；若库同为 system 同名库或需 shared
                         形态，仍按 E221/R26 处理